    "handout": "",
    "notes": "Welcome to day two of Medical Lien Balance Verification training. Yesterday set the foundation, and today we get practical. We will walk through how a lien balance verification request is built and sent, how to create and save it in the case management system, the best practices that go with it, the Final Lien Ledger, and how we track every balance so nothing is missed before the case closes."
