    "handout": "",
    "notes": "Here is our outline for today. We start with the Lien Balance Verification Request itself, what goes into it and how it moves. Then we look at creating and saving the LBV, which is our short name for the lien balance verification. After that, CMS navigation and best practices, and we finish with tracking. Keep these four parts in mind, because each one builds on the one before it."
