    "from": "lv-day2, slide 8",
    "handout": "",
    "notes": "Sometimes a provider has sent the account to a collections agency. When that happens, the agency is who you contact about the balance. Ask specifically for the client's balance, and do not settle for a verbal figure. Request an email or fax confirmation that clearly displays the balance, so the file has written proof of what the agency says is owed."
