    "notes": "Government programs are another source of liens. In some cases, governmental programs or public assistance entities that provided aid, such as Medicare or Medicaid, may file a lien for reimbursement. If the client received benefits through one of these programs for accident-related care, expect a reimbursement claim. Note whether the client is covered by Medicare or Medicaid early in the file so these claims are identified and verified with everything else."
